you identify the
beginning of a trend,

00:27:22.140 --> 00:27:24.640
the beginning of a story.

00:27:24.640 --> 00:27:27.810
So we've dug through some of
these features in Data Studio.

00:27:27.810 --> 00:27:30.540
One thing that I've really
