00:28:36.240 --> 00:28:41.350
Hey, let's look at just
2014, for instance.

00:28:41.350 --> 00:28:43.730
So it allows you to come
down here and select 2014.

00:28:43.730 --> 00:28:45.860
I've got this set
to single select.

00:28:45.860 --> 00:28:48.080
Looks like we might not
have data for that year.

00:28:48.080 --> 00:28:49.580
So I've got it set
to single select,

00:28:49.580 --> 00:28:51.780
so it will only show
